==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|тылъ||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|тꙑлъ}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*tylъ||back of the head, back}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-тыл.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Tatiana Kerbush-тыл.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|c|loc=+|adj=тылово́й}}

# [[back]], [[rear]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[с]] '''ты́ла'''|at the rear/from the rear/in the rear}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[подходи́ть]]/[[подойти́]] [[с]] '''ты́ла'''/'''ты́лу'''|to approach from the back}}
# {{lb|ru|military}} [[rear]] (the part of an army or fleet which comes last)
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Тыл''' Вооружëнных Сил Росси́йской Федера́ции|Rear of the Armed Forces of the Russian Federation}}
# {{lb|ru|military}} [[home front]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[народный|наро́дная]] [[борьба́]] [[в]] '''тылу́'''|popular struggle on '''the home front'''}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[служи́ть]]/[[послужи́ть]] [[в]] '''тылу́'''|to serve on '''the home front'''}}

====Usage notes====
A partitive case appears in the expression {{m|ru||с ты́лу|from the back}} (also {{m|ru||с ты́ла}}, with the expected genitive case).

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-table|c|loc=+|par=+}}

